/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"assumedRisks\":[],\"scopeChanges\":[],\"productionPathDecisionItems\":[]},\"diffReview\":{\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/cascade.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW: walk-and-clear cascade module (DD-8) — structural chain enumeration, supersede-delete of queued old-version items, replacement enqueues at next source version\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts\",\"reason\":\"edit's validation read (readMutableMessage, deleted-filtered, joined turn status) and record apply (applyMessageEdit: block content update + token re-stamp via the one estimator)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"messages.edit operation (one runInTransaction: validate → apply → cascade) and the MutationResult interface\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/messages-mutate.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW per §Placement: runMessagesEdit mirroring the SDK operation one-for-one\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"`lhc messages edit` command wiring, --message/--message-id and --content flags, HELP line\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"reason\":\"export MutationResult type on the public surface\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\",\"reason\":\"exclude the new cli-process-mutations suite outside LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1, matching the other process suites\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW: TC-5.1 through TC-5.5 plus the induced-failure atomicity leg and a background-mode edit-and-walk-away production-path test\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-mutations.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW: TC-5.6 SDK/CLI twin parity (result JSON, cascade rows, read-back) plus CLI refusal parity\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\",\"reason\":\"recorded the two new test files' hashes (green may add files