fter the post-edit replacement is queued and discards as stale_discarded. CLI: new src/cli/messages-mutate.ts and `lhc messages edit --message/--message-id --content` wiring with parity proven through the spawned binary.\",\"acceptanceRationale\":\"Story-lead is pausing for caller ruling 05-message-edit-cascade-story-run-001-ruling-spec-deviation before impl-lead can accept the story.\"},\"evidence\":{\"implementorArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"selfReviewArtifacts\":[],\"verifierArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/004-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/005-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"quickFixArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"quick-fix-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/quick-fix/001-quick-fix.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"callerInputArtifacts\":[],\"gateRuns\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}]},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"F-05-001\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"messages.edit now refuses turnless/no-membership targets with turn_open and unchanged read-back per 005-verify.json.\"]},{\"id\":\"spec-deviations\",\"status\":\"accepted-risk\",\"evidence\":[\"Impl-lead approved the four documented deviations in 001-ruling-response-001.json.\"]}]},\"riskAndDeviationReview\":{\"specDeviations\":[{\"description\":\"TC-5.6's CLI parity legs live in a new test/cli-process-mutations.test.ts instead of test/cli-process-work.test.ts named by the story's test mapping: that file is hash-locked by the Story 1 red manifest (green may add files, not edit) — same precedent Story 4 set with cli-process-report-repair.test.ts\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"TC-5.4 holds the claimed pre-edit item via an unawaited manual-mode work.drain promise rather than background mode + drainSettled, so the drain report's stale_discarded disposition is directly assertable (the test plan's storage-contract note requires that assertion); the claimed-item-held-across-the-edit overlap is identical, and background mode is separately proven by the edit-and-walk-away test\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"CLI accepts both --message (the story's and tech design's spelling) and --message-id (the house convention used by report/requeue); both parse into the same input\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"For tool_call blocks the edit's content string lands verbatim as the new arguments value (estimate re-stamped from its serialization, mirroring projection); the design's edit signature is content: string for all kinds and only text-kind edits are TC-covered — noted for the Story 6/verifier record\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"assumedRisks\":[],\"scopeChanges\":[],\"productionPathDecisionItems\":[]},\"diffReview\":{\"changedFiles\":[],\"storyScopedAssessment\":\"Story-lead package is scoped to orchestration evidence and impl-lead handoff data.\"},\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"story-gate-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"pnpm run verify-all\"],\"reasoning\":\"Story gate pnpm run verify-all reported pass.\"},{\"name\":\"final-verifier-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/005-verify.json\"],\"reasoning\":\"Final verifier outcome is pass.\"},{\"name\":\"unresolved-findings-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No unresolved verifier findings remain.\"},{\"name\":\"scope-change-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No scope changes require further ruling.\"},{\"name\":\"production-path-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No production-path decisions require further approval.\"},{\"name\":\"baseline-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"baselineBefore=208\",\"baselineAfter=217\"],\"reasoning\":\"The current baseline did not drop below the prior accepte