age-edit-cascade-story-run-001-ruling-spec-deviation\",\"decision\":\"approve\",\"rationale\":\"All four deviations approved: (1) CLI parity legs in new test/cli-process-mutations.test.ts — the named file is hash-locked by the Story 1 red manifest; same precedent as Story 4; (2) TC-5.4 via an unawaited manual-mode drain holding the real claimed pre-edit item across the edit satisfies the anti-shim rule (real claimed old-version item, delayed double, no source-version poking) while making the drain report's stale_discarded disposition directly assertable per the test plan's storage-contract note; background mode separately proven; (3) --message/--message-id flag aliases parse to one input — additive ergonomics; (4) tool_call edit content-lands-verbatim is consistent with the design's content: string signature; flagged for the Story 6 record. No contract drift.\",\"source\":\"impl-lead\"}]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"NEEDS_RULING\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":\"05-message-edit-cascade\",\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":\"story-orchestrate\",\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"11cfbce6-8c6f-47e4-8ae9-6d1d829e88b4\",\"storyId\":\"05-message-edit-cascade\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019eb551-8be9-7382-8a9c-1175cc0fca3e\",\"storyId\":\"05-message-edit-cascade\"}},\"storyReceiptDraft\":{\"storyId\":\"05-message-edit-cascade\",\"storyTitle\":\"Story 5: Message Edit and Cascade\",\"implementorEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\"],\"verifierEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-